<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="<%= theme || 'light' %>">
<%- include('partials/shell/head-start', { pageTitle: 'About - Zettelrobbe' }) %>
<%- include('partials/shell/head-end') %>
<%- include('partials/shell/body-open', {
    pageTitle: 'About',
    version: typeof version !== 'undefined' ? version : '',
    chatEnabled: typeof chatEnabled !== 'undefined' ? chatEnabled : false
}) %>
            <div class="zr-col zr-col--loose">
                <div class="zr-viewhead">
                    <p class="zr-viewhead__sub">Support information, project background, and author details.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="zr-module">
                    <h3 class="zr-module__title">💖 Support the Project</h3>
                    <div class="zr-col zr-muted">
                        <p>
                            If you find this tool helpful, consider supporting its development:
                        </p>
                        <div class="zr-row zr-row--wrap">
                            <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/admonstrator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub Sponsors" class="zr-row">
                                <img class="no-invert" alt="GitHub Sponsors" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-Sponsors-EA4AAA?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github">
                            </a>
                            <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/admon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Buy Me A Coffee" class="zr-row">
                                <img class="no-invert" alt="Buy Me A Coffee" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Buy%20Me%20A%20Coffee-FFDD00?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=buy-me-a-coffee&amp;logoColor=black">
                            </a>
                            <a href="https://ko-fi.com/admon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Ko-fi" class="zr-row">
                                <img class="no-invert" alt="Ko-fi" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white">
                            </a>
                            <a href="https://paypal.me/aaronviehl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="PayPal" class="zr-row">
                                <img class="no-invert" alt="PayPal" src="https://img.shields.io/badge/PayPal-00457C?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=paypal&amp;logoColor=white">
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="zr-module">
                    <h3 class="zr-module__title">System Information (Support)</h3>
                    <div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>App Version:</strong> <%= supportInfo.appVersion %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Build Commit SHA:</strong> <span class="zr-mono"><%= supportInfo.commitSha %></span></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Node.js:</strong> <%= supportInfo.nodeVersion %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Platform:</strong> <%= supportInfo.platform %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Environment:</strong> <%= supportInfo.nodeEnv %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>AI Provider:</strong> <%= supportInfo.aiProvider %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Uptime:</strong> <%= supportInfo.uptime %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Server Time (UTC):</strong> <%= supportInfo.serverTimeUtc %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Server Timezone:</strong> <%= supportInfo.timezone %></div>
                        <div class="zr-panel"><strong>Mistral OCR Enabled:</strong> <%= supportInfo.ocrEnabled ? 'yes' : 'no' %></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="zr-module">
                    <h3 class="zr-module__title">Issue Reporting</h3>
                    <p class="zr-sm zr-muted">
                        Open a prefilled issue report with version and environment details, or copy diagnostics to your clipboard.
                    </p>
                    <div class="zr-row zr-row--wrap">
                        <a
                            id="openPrefilledIssueBtn"
                            href="https://github.com/admonstrator/zettelrobbe/issues/new?template=bug_report.yml"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer"
                            class="zr-btn zr-btn--primary">
                            <svg class="zr-icon zr-icon--sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-bug"/></svg>Open Issue Form
                        </a>
                        <button
                            id="copyIssueDiagnosticsBtn"
                            type="button"
                            class="zr-btn">
                            <svg class="zr-icon zr-icon--sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-copy"/></svg>Copy Issue Details
                        </button>
                        <span id="issueHelperStatus" class="zr-sm zr-faint"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="zr-module">
                    <h3 class="zr-module__title">This app is awesome because ✨</h3>
                    <div class="zr-col zr-muted">
                        <p>
                            No corporate blah blah - just useful stuff that makes daily document chaos easier to handle 😄
                        </p>
                        <ul class="zr-col zr-col--tight" style="padding-left: var(--zr-4)">
                            <li>⚡ Faster dashboard and history pages → less waiting, more doing</li>
                            <li>🧠 Smarter OCR + AI fallback flows → fewer dead ends when documents are messy</li>
                            <li>🛡️ Stronger security defaults → safer setup out of the box</li>
                            <li>🐳 Cleaner Docker workflows → easier updates and less deployment pain</li>
                            <li>📊 Better status + failure visibility → you immediately see what needs attention</li>
                            <li>🧰 Practical support info page → easier bug reports and faster help</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            End result: smoother daily use, cool new features and more magic! 🌟
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            ❤️ Big, fat thank you to the original project:
                            <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/clusterzx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@clusterzx</a>
                            and
                            <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/clusterzx/paperless-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">clusterzx/paperless-ai</a>.
                            This fork stands on that foundation.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="zr-module">
                    <h3 class="zr-module__title">About the Author 👋</h3>
                    <div class="zr-sm zr-muted zr-col zr-col--tight">
                        <p>
                            Meet the maintainer behind this fork: <strong>admonstrator (Aaron Viehl)</strong> 🔥
                            (<a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/admonstrator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@admonstrator</a>)
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Aaron is all about building practical tools that actually help in daily operations:<br />
                            less noise, more reliability, smarter automation, fewer annoying edge-case surprises 💪<br />
                            Also known as “the grumpy nerd next door,” he is CTO at
                            <a class="zr-link" href="https://singleton-factory.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@singleton-factory</a>,
                            based in Germany.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Want updates, ideas, or just nerdy tech talk? 👇<br />
                            <a class="zr-link" href="https://admon.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">admon.me</a>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I am a trained IT specialist for system integration, not a classic full-time software engineer — and yes,
                            I use AI heavily to move faster. But every change still gets human review, hands-on testing, and a lot of
                            iteration time from me until it is stable, practical, and trustworthy in daily use. If you find issues, have ideas, or want to contribute, please reach out! ❤️🙌
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="zr-module">
                    <h3 class="zr-module__title">Credits</h3>
                    <div class="zr-col zr-muted">
                        <p>
                            This project exists because many people contribute in different ways. Thank you for helping make
                            Zettelrobbe better for everyone.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="zr-col zr-col--tight" style="padding-left: var(--zr-4)">
                            <li>
                                Original project and core foundation:
                                <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/clusterzx" target="_blank"
                                    rel="noopener noreferrer">@clusterzx</a>
                                and
                                <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/clusterzx/paperless-ai"
                                    target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">clusterzx/paperless-ai</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Fork maintainer:
                                <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/admonstrator" target="_blank"
                                    rel="noopener noreferrer">@admonstrator</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Community code contributors:
                                <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/claymore666" target="_blank"
                                    rel="noopener noreferrer">@claymore666</a>
                                and
                                <a class="zr-link" href="https://github.com/saschabuehrle" target="_blank"
                                    rel="noopener noreferrer">@saschabuehrle</a>
                            </li>
                            <li>Users and testers who report bugs, verify fixes, and provide clear reproduction steps</li>
                            <li>Everyone supporting the project with feedback, patience, and encouragement</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            Want to be listed here with a specific contribution? Open an issue or pull request and say hello.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script id="supportInfoPayload" type="application/json"><%- JSON.stringify(supportInfo || {}).replace(/</g, '\\u003c') %></script>

    <%- include('partials/scripts/about-scripts') %>
    <%- include('partials/shell/body-close') %>
